    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton class for managing output messages in the Marmot framework. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a centralized way to handle warning and notification messages, allowing them to be directed to a specified output stream (e.g., console, file). </para>
